      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUSHFORTH BAZ (6) was below best at his last start when 6th at this track following a third place finish (20.50) there two back. Has a good record here at this journey. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Has ability and looks hard to stop. NAUTICAL BLUE (1) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Sandave Apache (20.40) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature again. LEVCHENKO (8) was in the minors two back (20.48) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Key runner on best form. WAGYU BOY (3) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
